<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title></title>
  <style>
    .container {
      margin: 0 auto;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 600px;
      padding: 0 0px;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      font-family: 'Franklin Gothic Medium', 'Arial Narrow', Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .otp {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: xx-large;
      font-weight: bolder;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    }

    .header {
      font-weight: bold;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <a>Prove Your WebMarketplace Identity</a>
    </div>

    <p>
      We have received a login request for your WebMarketplace account. For
      security purposes, please verify your identity by providing the
      following code.
      <br />
      <br />
      <b>Your verification code is:</b>
    </p>


    <h2 class="otp">{{ code }}</h2>

    <p style="font-size: 0.9em; ">
      <strong>This code is valid for 3 minutes.</strong>
      <br />
      <br />
      If it wasn`t you, please ignore this message.<br />
      <strong>Do not forward or give this code to anyone.</strong>
    </p>
  </div>
  <div style="text-align: center">
    &copy; 2026 WebMarketplace
  </div>
</body>
</html>
